                "text": "bouncycastle: BC-JAVA: LDAP injection vulnerability in LDAPStoreHelper.java"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Improper neutralization of special elements used in an LDAP query ('LDAP injection') vulnerability in Legion of the Bouncy Castle Inc. BC-JAVA bcprov on all (prov modules).\n\n This vulnerability is associated with program files LDAPStoreHelper.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects BC-JAVA: from 1.74 before 1.80.2, from 1.81 before 1.81.1, from 1.82 before 1.84."
